<title>USA: Qualcomm seeks judgment on patent.</title>
<headline>Qualcomm seeks judgment on patent.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qualcomm Inc said Thursday it has filed a complaint in the U.S. District Court in San Diego seeking a judgment that it does not infringe three patents held by Philips Electronics NV unit U.S. Philips Corp.</p>
<p>Qualcomm's complaint states that a dispute has arisen from Philips' contention that the three patents cover certain features of Qualcomm products compatible with the Telecommunication Industry Association's IS-95-A standard.</p>
<p>Qualcomm denies that its products infringe any of the three patents and said it believes the patents are invalid.</p>
</text>
